  "question": "Where can I find a caf\u00e9 that fall within 100 kilometers in the east direction of Senior Helpers, Largo, FL?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-82.769703 27.919893)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-82.769703 27.919893)',4326)::geography, 100000)\nAND amenity = 'cafe'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 67.5 AND 112.5;\n",
